{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 112 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "169b379daf05d247b96431f70ace46cf0c7c7e647468d01565caf8771ec76e4a" :edb/db-before-t 111 :edb/db-after-t 112 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533424 50 #inst "2026-10-10T07:46:14.042Z" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054626 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332987 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054637 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332832 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054677 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332971 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054688 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332837 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054689 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332838 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054690 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332844 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054852 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332904 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054852 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332905 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186054853 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332907 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055370 1068 #edb/ref 17592186053427 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186055370 1068 #edb/ref 17592186332400 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055370 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055370 1071 "If $a_{n + 2} = a_{n + 1} + a_{n}$ with $a_{1} = 0$ and $a_{2} = 1$, then $a_{3} =$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186055370 1071 "If ${a}_{n+2}={a}_{n+1}+{a}_{n}$ with ${a}_{1}=0$ and ${a}_{2}=1,$ then ${a}_{3}=$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055370 1074 "The recursive formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+2}={a}_{n+1}+{a}_{n}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=1$ into the recursive formula gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1+2} & ={a}_{1+1}+{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{3} & ={a}_{2}+{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{3} & =1+0 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055372 1068 #edb/ref 17592186053439 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186055372 1068 #edb/ref 17592186332314 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055372 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055372 1071 "Find the slope of the tangent at the point $(0, 1)$ for the curve $x^{2} + xy - y^{2} =-1$." 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186055372 1071 "Find the slope of the tangent at the point $(0,\\,1)$ for the curve ${x}^{2}+xy-{y}^{2}=-1.$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186055372 1074 "To find the slope at a point, we use implicit differentiation to calculate the derivative of the curve, assuming that $y=y(x).$\n\nNote that to differentiate the $xy$ term, we will need to use the product rule.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+xy-{y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(xy)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2x+x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+y\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2x+x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+y-2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ (2x+y)+(x-2y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{2x+y}{x-2y}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe slope of the tangent at the point $(0,\\,1)$ is then given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & ={(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}_{(0,\\,1)} \\\\  & ={(-\\frac{2x+y}{x-2y})}_{(0,\\,1)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2\\cdot 0+1}{0-2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{0+1}{0-2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{(-2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186059796 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332903 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186059796 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332937 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186059797 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332946 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186059814 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332936 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186060300 1068 #edb/ref 17592186058392 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186060300 1068 #edb/ref 17592186332312 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186060300 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186060300 1071 "$\\frac{3}{3+2\\text{i}}=$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186060300 1071 "What is $\\frac{3}{3 + 2\\textrm{i}}$?" 13194139533424 17592186045585 false] [17592186060300 1074 "The denominator is $3+2\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $3-2\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $3-2\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{3+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{3}{3+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{3-2\\text{i}}{3-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{9-6\\text{i}+6\\text{i}-4{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{9-4{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{9-(4)(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{9+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9-6\\text{i}}{13}=\\frac{9}{13}-\\frac{6}{13}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064176 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332672 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064186 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332668 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064187 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332667 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064188 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332669 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064189 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332665 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064189 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332670 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064189 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332671 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064191 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332673 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064203 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332685 13194139533424 17592186045585 true] [17592186064203 1038 #edb/ref 17592186332686 13194139533424 17592186045585 